    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4221374deef617c42854ca715d54515de8602edc13c2cf1a7e87a6a2edff2236",
      "text": "Duration: 6 HoursPick-Up: 8:45 – 9:30 AMLanguages: English and Spanish\n\nAfter the tour, you will return to your hotel, or you may choose to stay out and enjoy lunch while continuing to experience the rhythm of the city.\n\nRound-trip transportation is included for a smooth and comfortable tour.\n\nIncluded:• Shared transportation• Certified bilingual guide• Entrance to the National Museum of Anthropology• City tour• Overnight stay in Mexico City\n\nNot Included:• Meals• Drinks• Tips• Personal expenses",
